# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) and this package divide the work rather than overlap, along a single line:\n"
msgstr "Naghahati ang [ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) at ang package na ito ng trabaho imbes na magpatong, sa isang linya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| ffsim owns                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | `qiskit-fermions` owns                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| The high-level ansatz *operators* ([`UCJOpSpinBalanced`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced \"(in ffsim)\"), [`UCCSDOpRestrictedReal`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCCSDOpRestrictedReal.html#ffsim.UCCSDOpRestrictedReal \"(in ffsim)\") and their siblings), built from coupled-cluster amplitudes or a parameter vector | The fermionic *circuit* ([`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")) those operators become, and its transpilation into a qubit circuit under any fermion-to-qubit encoding |\n"
"| Fast simulation in a compact fixed-particle-number space                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | The mapper framework and the operator data structures the circuit is built from                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pag-aari ng ffsim | Pag-aari ng `qiskit-fermions` |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| Ang mga high-level na ansatz *operator* ([`UCJOpSpinBalanced`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced \"(in ffsim)\"), [`UCCSDOpRestrictedReal`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCCSDOpRestrictedReal.html#ffsim.UCCSDOpRestrictedReal \"(in ffsim)\") at ang mga kamag-anak nila), na binuo mula sa coupled-cluster amplitude o parameter vector | Ang fermionic *circuit* ([`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")) na kinahihinatnan ng mga operator na iyon, at ang transpilation nito tungo sa qubit circuit sa ilalim ng anumang fermion-to-qubit encoding |\n"
"| Mabilis na simulation sa isang compact na fixed-particle-number na espasyo | Ang mapper framework at ang mga operator data structure na pinagbubuuan ng circuit |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The practical consequence runs both ways. The ansatz math lives in ffsim, so [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") and [`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\") take an ffsim operator directly as their input. Conversely, ffsim’s own Qiskit gates are specific to the Jordan-Wigner transformation, so lowering one of its ansatz operators through a *different* encoding is what bringing it here buys you.\n"
msgstr "Dalawang direksyon ang praktikal na kahihinatnan. Nasa ffsim ang ansatz math, kaya ang [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") at [`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\") ay direktang tumatanggap ng ffsim operator bilang input nila. Sa kabilang banda, partikular sa Jordan-Wigner transformation ang sariling mga Qiskit gate ng ffsim, kaya ang makukuha mo sa pagdadala nito rito ay ang pag-lower ng isa sa mga ansatz operator nito sa pamamagitan ng *ibang* encoding.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulation is where the two meet, and this guide explains how. ffsim is this package’s simulation backend, reached through its own protocols rather than a wrapper: the [SKQD guide](skqd#skqd-getting-started) calls [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\"), [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\"), and [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") directly on [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")objects and [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\")objects, with no conversion step.\n"
msgstr "Dito nagtatagpo ang dalawa sa simulation, at ipinapaliwanag ito ng gabay na ito. Ang ffsim ang simulation backend ng package na ito, na naaabot sa pamamagitan ng sarili nitong mga protocol imbes na wrapper: tinatawag ng [SKQD guide](skqd#skqd-getting-started) ang [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\"), [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\"), at [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") nang direkta sa mga [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")object at [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\")object, na walang hakbang ng conversion.\n"

