# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Browse [`qiskit_fermions.protocols`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols#module-qiskit_fermions.protocols \"qiskit_fermions.protocols\") for the full catalog of protocols this package defines, including the conversion protocols ([`SupportsFermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols-supports-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsFermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsFermionOperator\"), [`SupportsMajoranaOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols-supports-majorana-operator#qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsMajoranaOperator \"qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsMajoranaOperator\")) that are unrelated to ffsim.\n"
msgstr "I-browse ang [`qiskit_fermions.protocols`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols#module-qiskit_fermions.protocols \"qiskit_fermions.protocols\") para sa buong katalogo ng mga protocol na dine-define ng package na ito, kasama ang mga conversion protocol ([`SupportsFermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols-supports-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsFermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsFermionOperator\"), [`SupportsMajoranaOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols-supports-majorana-operator#qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsMajoranaOperator \"qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsMajoranaOperator\")) na walang kaugnayan sa ffsim.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read [ffsim’s own guides](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/) for the workflows it owns, in particular [building a UCJ ansatz](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html) and [optimizing one variationally](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/simulate-vqe.html). The parameter vectors those guides drive are what [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") and [`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\") accept, through the operators they build.\n"
msgstr "Basahin ang [sariling mga gabay ng ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/) para sa mga workflow na pagmamay-ari nito, lalo na ang [pagbuo ng UCJ ansatz](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html) at [pag-optimize nito nang variational](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/simulate-vqe.html). Ang mga parameter vector na minamaneho ng mga gabay na iyon ang tinatanggap ng [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") at [`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\"), sa pamamagitan ng mga operator na binubuo nila.\n"
